{"data": {"repository": {"pullRequest": {"reviewThreads": {"pageInfo": {"hasNextPage": true, "endCursor": "p1"}, "nodes": [{"id": "T1", "isResolved": false, "isOutdated": false, "path": "lib/widgets/filter.py", "line": 3, "originalLine": 3, "startLine": null, "diffSide": "RIGHT", "comments": {"nodes": [{"databaseId": 8001, "author": {"login": "reviewer-two"}, "body": "`MAX_SIZE` is never read. Either use it in the size check or drop it; a constant nobody reads will confuse the next reader.", "createdAt": "2026-03-03T09:01:00Z", "url": "https://github.com/example/widgets/pull/42#discussion_r8001", "originalCommit": {"oid": "a72c8862aa73edbeaedbf5f35fb2b283c6ec6c9b"}}, {"databaseId": 8002, "author": {"login": "octo-dev"}, "body": "It was meant for a later `max_size` option. I will drop it until that lands.", "createdAt": "2026-03-03T10:15:00Z", "url": "https://github.com/example/widgets/pull/42#discussion_r8002", "originalCommit": {"oid": "a72c8862aa73edbeaedbf5f35fb2b283c6ec6c9b"}}]}}, {"id": "T2", "isResolved": true, "isOutdated": false, "path": "lib/widgets/catalog.py", "line": 37, "originalLine": 37, "startLine": null, "diffSide": "RIGHT", "comments": {"nodes": [{"databaseId": 8003, "author": {"login": "reviewer-two"}, "body": "Building a new `Catalog` here means the default list is copied twice. Pass the filtered list straight in:\n\n```suggestion\n    def filtered(self, colour=None, min_size=None):\n        return Catalog(filter_widgets(self.widgets, colour, min_size))\n```", "createdAt": "2026-03-03T09:02:00Z", "url": "https://github.com/example/widgets/pull/42#discussion_r8003", "originalCommit": {"oid": "f66400410996cbed33edd573a0ca529a32e9054d"}}, {"databaseId": 8004, "author": {"login": "octo-dev"}, "body": "Taken, thanks.", "createdAt": "2026-03-03T10:20:00Z", "url": "https://github.com/example/widgets/pull/42#discussion_r8004", "originalCommit": {"oid": "f66400410996cbed33edd573a0ca529a32e9054d"}}]}}, {"id": "T3", "isResolved": false, "isOutdated": false,